      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town began as Pax in the early 1870s before becoming Belle Plaine and finally Stotts City.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Stotts_City%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In its heyday, Stotts City hosted a volunteer brass band, a newspaper called The Stotts City Sunbeam, and several banks and churches.",
